                                "sense_id": "abb40abe-07fa-371f-9e53-e435b7af6c16",
                                "text": "She specialized in cats and kittens, often misbehaving – playing with balls of wool, upsetting milk jugs – in the sort of affluent middle-class salon that was the natural habitat of her adoring patronage.",
